>
  <h2>Editorial</h2>
  <p>For editorial questions, sourcing concerns or story-related correspondence, the dedicated publication channel will appear here once it is active.</p>
  <h2>Corrections</h2>
  <p>Correction requests should identify the article, the disputed passage and the factual basis for the requested change. See the <a href="/corrections">corrections policy</a>.</p>
  <h2>Business, advertising and rights</h2>
  <p>Commercial, sponsorship and rights enquiries will use separate publication channels so they remain distinct from editorial correspondence.</p>
</InstitutionalPage>
